Docs by Kabeer's Network (kabeers.network)
Service available for free at https://docs.kabeers.network
-------------------------------------------------------------

Mono-repo contains source-code for Libre Docs / Kabeer's Docs
Next.js application available in `client@web`. 

Docs depends on Kabeer's Network's cloudstore service for data
-> (https://github.com/Kabeers-Network/cloudstore-release/)

Other microservices like those responsible for authentication
will be added to this repository. 

Project is open to external contributors, We currently do not
have a fancy CI/CD pipeline or moderation, leave me a PR here
and I will manually merge. 

If you find any bug or issue, kindly open a new issue in this
repository, with steps to reproduce and imagery.

